sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant OS as Order Service<br/>(API + Order DB)
    participant OR as Saga Orchestrator<br/>(Order Service)
    participant MB as Message Broker
    participant IS as Inventory Service
    participant PS as Payment Service
    participant PG as Gateway Financeiro<br/>(externo)

    C->>OS: POST /orders [sync]
    OS->>OS: TX local: Order=PENDING, Saga=STARTED
    OS-->>C: 202 Accepted (orderId)

    OR->>MB: ReserveStock (sagaId)
    MB->>IS: ReserveStock
    IS->>IS: TX local: reserva estoque (Reservation=RESERVED)
    IS->>MB: StockReserved
    MB->>OR: StockReserved
    OR->>OR: Saga=STOCK_RESERVED

    OR->>MB: ProcessPayment (sagaId)
    MB->>PS: ProcessPayment
    PS->>PG: POST /charges [Idempotency-Key=sagaId]
    PG-->>PS: 402 pagamento recusado
    PS->>PS: TX local: Payment=REJECTED
    PS->>MB: PaymentRejected (sagaId, motivo)
    MB->>OR: PaymentRejected

    rect rgb(255, 232, 232)
        Note over OR,OS: Início da compensação (Saga=COMPENSATING)
        OR->>OR: Saga=COMPENSATING
        OR->>MB: ReleaseStock (sagaId) [transação compensatória]
        MB->>IS: ReleaseStock
        IS->>IS: TX local: Reservation=RELEASED, estoque devolvido
        IS->>MB: StockReleased (sagaId)
        MB->>OR: StockReleased
        OR->>OS: CancelOrder: Order=CANCELED (PAYMENT_DECLINED)
        OR->>OR: Saga=COMPENSATED
    end

    OR->>MB: OrderCanceled (evento de domínio)
    C->>OS: GET /orders/orderId (consulta ou notificação)
    OS-->>C: status=CANCELED, motivo=PAYMENT_DECLINED

    Note over OR,IS: ReleaseStock e CancelOrder são retentáveis e idempotentes: repetir não causa efeito extra
